    "background_story": "Rosalina had been working as a cashier at the local grocery store for over a decade. She took pride in her work, always ensuring that every customer left the store with a smile on their face. Her warm demeanor and kind words made her a beloved fixture in the community. Rosalina knew many of her customers by name and was always willing to lend a helping hand, whether it was carrying groceries to their car or offering a sympathetic ear. Despite the long hours and demanding pace, Rosalina remained dedicated to her job, taking joy in the simple interactions that made a difference in people's lives. Her manager often praised her for being the 'face of the store', and Rosalina felt a sense of fulfillment knowing that she was making a positive impact on her customers' daily lives.",
